    "mview": {
      "comment": "The M View tab (mview.js): read only while it shows, one request at a time, after the ambient light's writes. Engine oil and coolant come from the car's own signals (CDS statusEngineTemperature, VehicleInformation DataPowerTrain2); these candidates only while the car sends none. oil / coolant / iat: OBD service 01 PIDs 5C / 05 / 0F from the engine unit (DME 0x12; a G26's answers service 01, it refuses many 22 F4xx), then the same over UDS. egs: gearbox oil from the gearbox unit (EGS 0x18), the car's BasicDataSet never arrives on a G26. misfire: OBD service 06 monitors (A1 = all cylinders, A2 = cylinder 1 ...), tid 0C = misfires this driving cycle, 0B = average of the last 10; an engine unit that refuses service 06 is asked 22 F6xx. stft / ltft / timing (Fuel trims & timing card, 2.4.2): OBD service 01 PIDs 06 / 07 / 0E from the engine unit (bank 1: a B58 has one), then the same over UDS 22 F4xx.",
